      "created_at": "2017-10-27T07:25:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Salvete! I'm a forum rookie who mostly plays digitally. I recently had enough free time to start playing again and I found out that the XTREME Prime Warden cards have been unlocked. I like finding unusual ways to screw with different villains (i.e. triggering Gloomweaver's insta-lose with Parse) and I was wondering if XTREME Tempest's \"Thunderstruck\" was particularly good against certain Villains. So far, all I've found is Iron Legecy's heavy Melee damage and La Capitan's minions but I feel like I'm missing something big.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:20.894Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
